WEBVTT

00:01:27.542 --> 00:01:31.129
So I had an unusual idea:

00:01:32.296 --> 00:01:36.217
I should be a nuclear energy influencer.

00:01:38.219 --> 00:01:41.139
I wanted to make nuclear energy cool.

00:01:42.014 --> 00:01:43.933
Inspired by internet culture,

00:01:43.975 --> 00:01:48.896
I created a digital version of me
and called her Isodope.

00:01:49.772 --> 00:01:50.773
(Laughter)

00:01:50.815 --> 00:01:53.609
She's sassy,

00:01:53.609 --> 00:01:54.986
a little weird,

00:01:55.027 --> 00:01:56.904
but she always tells the truth.

00:01:57.321 --> 00:01:59.574
And here, you can see her in action.